@startuml unified_events_http
title Unified Events v2 HTTP Activation
' Contract baseline: pi-mono-java-design 2ee2a3211da68ad87b0d9cab353e691b00bdaebd
' Java baseline: ffab13a69127e5e605df3b0319bf19f55f0e1d3f
' Implementation tip: 77348ee9e2e6d8b68cf2a86572b09754eeb6ae49
' Source: modules/coding-agent-cli/src/main/java/com/campusclaw/codingagent/runtimeapi/web/RuntimeEventController.java#submit and list
' Source: modules/coding-agent-cli/src/main/java/com/campusclaw/codingagent/runtimeapi/event/RuntimeV2EventService.java#submit
' Source: modules/coding-agent-cli/src/main/java/com/campusclaw/codingagent/runtimeapi/event/RuntimeResultBackedEventOutput.java#emit
' Source: modules/coding-agent-cli/src/main/java/com/campusclaw/codingagent/runtimeapi/web/RuntimeExceptionHandler.java#response
' Pi source: packages/server/src/sessions.ts#LiveSessionManager.executeCommand at 4af9d21d3b4d664e4a29fcabfec85171077248e3
' Observed behavior: the Java controller activates one strict union endpoint and one authoritative history endpoint.
' Design reason: request shape, data-only streaming, history projection, and route retirement must change atomically.
' Java divergence: cross-process controls and committed public events are CampusClaw architecture changes.
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
actor "Client" as client
component "RuntimeEventController" as controller
component "Strict event deserializer" as decoder
component "RuntimeV2EventService" as service
component "Message acceptance" as message
component "Control acceptance" as control
component "Local dispatcher" as dispatcher
database "Committed event store" as store
component "Result waiter and poller" as result
queue "Data-only SSE" as sse
component "CommittedEventQueryService" as query

client --> controller : POST event union
controller --> decoder : deserialize and validate
decoder --> service : one sealed event VO
service --> message : user.message
service --> control : interrupt or confirmation
control --> dispatcher : local fast path
dispatcher ..> store : remote polling fallback
message --> store : receipt and execution events
control --> store : control receipt
store --> result : fixed execution or segment results
result --> sse : committed complete events
message --> sse : receipt and previews
sse --> client : JSON data frames

client --> controller : GET page and limit
controller --> query : list committed events
query --> store : authoritative projection
query --> client : result envelope

note bottom of controller
Retired abort, steers, and follow-ups routes are absent.
Pre-acceptance errors use application/json.
end note
@enduml
